What This Macro Does (Simple Flow)

1. Loops through all Excel files in Supplier Evaluation Form


2. Extracts OP_Code from file name


3. Searches Column N (from Row 12) in Template


4. If OP_Code is found:

Opens the evaluation form

Copies C10:C21

Pastes values into P13:P24 in Template

Closes the evaluation file





